16
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:20,759
No way. I don't want her here.

17
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,439
Li Haoyu.

18
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:28,120
It's his place.

19
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,759
Why should he leave?

20
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:41,560
[A woman with a child]

21
