[came to buy candy.]

22
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,439
[But before she could buy,]

23
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,520
[the child started crying,]

24
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,280
[demanding candy.]

25
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:51,639
[Zhang Binggui]

26
00:02:51,639 --> 00:02:53,439
[picked up a piece of candy from the shelf]

27
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,360
[and placed it in the child's hand.]

28
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:57,520
[The child immediately...]

29
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:57,919
What's wrong?

30
00:02:57,919 --> 00:02:58,599
[stopped crying.]

31
00:02:58,599 --> 00:02:59,719
Didn't you say you were looking

32
