33
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:02,039
Didn't find one?

34
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:07,039
We did,

35
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:08,400
but...

36
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,360
But what?

37
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:12,919
But...

38
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,840
Stand up.

39
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,759
Where was I?

40
00:03:28,479 --> 00:03:29,599
Sorry, sir.

41
00:03:30,879 --> 00:03:31,879
After a while...

42
00:03:32,159 --> 00:03:32,840
Keep reading.

43
00:03:34,599 --> 00:03:35,919
After a while...

44
00:03:35,919 --> 00:03:37,080
Louder!

45
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,080
After a while,

46
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,719
when it was her turn to buy candy,

47
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:42,919
Lao Zhang took some from the weighed candies...

48
00:03:43,159 --> 00:03:45,439
So the function reaches its local minimum

49
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:46,919
at X equals 0,

50
00:03:46,919 --> 00:03:48,240
which is 0.

51
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,759
But remember,

52
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:50,879
the domain restriction.

53
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,039
Jiang Yi, excellent answer.

54
00:03:53,039 --> 00:03:53,639
Please, have a seat.

55
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:55,800
That's all

56
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,520
for the first derivative test.

57
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,919
If anyone's still struggling,

58
00:03:57,919 --> 00:03:59,199
go back and review the textbook.

59
00:03:59,199 --> 00:04:00,039
Make sure you understand it.

60
00:04:00,039 --> 00:04:01,280
Now, let's turn to

61
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,639
the second derivative test.

62
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:10,840
Let's look at the prerequisites.

63
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:14,199
f(x) has a second derivative

64
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:15,759
at point x0.

65
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:28,959
So strange.

66
00:04:31,439 --> 00:04:32,399
Li Haoyu

67
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:34,000
is a nice guy.

68
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:35,639
Why is he so abnormal

69
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:36,560
with Jiang Yi?

70
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:39,000
From a behavior analysis,

71
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,639
the most direct stimulus

72
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:42,360
usually comes from competition.

73
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:44,240
For example,

74
00:04:45,319 --> 00:04:46,199
grades.

75
