77
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:55,480
Sorry,

78
00:04:55,839 --> 00:04:56,360
I can't teach

79
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:57,600
a fool like you.

80
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:01,680
Gu Chenyang,

81
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:03,720
is this what you want to say

82
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,639
to Li Haoyu?

83
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,839
Jiang Yi wouldn't be so blunt.

84
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,920
Besides,

85
00:05:08,319 --> 00:05:09,800
if Li Haoyu was spoken to like that,

86
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:11,000
he would've retorted on the spot.

87
00:05:12,199 --> 00:05:13,279
Then...

88
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,040
Relatives?

89
00:05:15,319 --> 00:05:16,560
Family feuds?

90
00:05:35,199 --> 00:05:35,920
Yi,

91
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:38,360
this is your long-lost brother.

92
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:39,839
I just found him.

93
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,600
Sis,

94
00:05:43,079 --> 00:05:43,839
I don't have a brother

95
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:44,959
like you.

96
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:49,240
And don't even think about stealing my stuff.

97
00:05:58,680 --> 00:06:00,360
Stop acting in those cheesy dramas, bro.

98
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,439
Li Haoyu's family

99
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,879
is just a regular business family.

100
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:04,800
There's no

101
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:05,720
drama here.

102
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:08,600
Then there's only one possibility.

103
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:11,720
Jiang Yi bullied him.

104
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,920
Kid, give me your money.

105
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,560
No!

106
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,959
This is bullying!

107
00:06:24,959 --> 00:06:26,079
I'll tell the teacher!

108
00:06:26,079 --> 00:06:27,480
Stand still!

109
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:29,519
You asked for this!

110
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:31,360
Pull him over!

111
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,040
Why does Li Haoyu

112
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,600
always run away crying?

113
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,360
Maybe

114
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:52,920
everyone has their vulnerable moments.

115
00:06:55,319 --> 00:06:56,160
Forget it.

116
00:06:57,279 --> 00:06:58,279
It's useless to guess.

117
00:06:58,639 --> 00:07:00,199
I have something to do. I'll go first.

118
00:07:00,759 --> 00:07:03,319
Zhou Yang, it's your turn to analyze.

119
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,199
I have no idea.

120
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,079
It's faster to ask her.

121
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:11,839
Yeah.

122
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:13,680
Where is she?

123
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:28,439
Where is she?

124
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:35,639
Why am I so dizzy today?

125
00:07:47,439 --> 00:07:48,399
Jiang Yi.

126
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:02,879
Senior.

127
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:05,560
We just want to ask

128
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,079
if you ever bullied Li Haoyu.

129
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,720
What?

130
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:12,160
Are you here to get justice for him?

131
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,079
We're just curious.

132
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,279
Li Haoyu

133
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,560
is indeed a bit unusual this time.

134
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,360
If you care about him so much,

135
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,639
why don't you just ask him?

136
00:08:28,439 --> 00:08:30,360
He probably won't tell us.

137
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:32,679
But

138
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,480
aren't you friends?

139
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:43,559
I'll leave if there's nothing else.

140
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,000
Why are you here?

141
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,559
Why are you here?

142
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:54,000
Well,

143
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,759
