144
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,240
You're quite close to her.

145
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:58,440
We just

146
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,360
want to know about your relationship.

147
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:01,320
There's nothing between us.

148
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,799
Since you two get along,

149
00:09:02,799 --> 00:09:03,840
I'll leave.

150
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:05,840
Li Haoyu.

151
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:06,759
Don't follow me.

152
00:09:11,960 --> 00:09:13,240
What's going on?

153
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,879
Faking a fever this time?

154
00:09:21,200 --> 00:09:22,080
Your acting

155
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,279
is getting better.

156
00:09:23,759 --> 00:09:24,799
This time it's real.

157
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:25,759
Real or not,

158
00:09:25,759 --> 00:09:26,799
Let me check.

159
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,759
38.2 degrees.

160
00:09:31,759 --> 00:09:32,840
You really have a fever.

161
00:09:33,159 --> 00:09:34,559
When did you start feeling unwell?

162
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,320
For a while now.

163
00:09:36,799 --> 00:09:37,840
You always

164
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,840
pretend to be sick.

165
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:41,000
This time, it's real, huh?

166
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:43,240
I'll give you a sick note.

167
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,919
And some medicine.

168
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:46,720
You should

169
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:47,399
call your family

170
00:09:47,399 --> 00:09:48,159
and ask them

171
00:09:48,159 --> 00:09:49,799
to pick you up.

172
00:09:51,039 --> 00:09:52,039
I don't have anyone at home.

173
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,240
He's busy.

174
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:57,200
What about your friends from the basketball club?

175
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:58,200
Ask them to come

176
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,440
and take you home.

177
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:02,759
It's okay. I can go back by myself.

178
00:10:02,759 --> 00:10:03,559
Thank you, sir.

179
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:06,080
Get some rest.

180
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:07,480
Drink plenty of water.

181
00:10:08,919 --> 00:10:09,919
This kid.

182
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:34,559
Dad.

183
00:10:37,279 --> 00:10:38,480
Didn't you say you were playing basketball with your friends

184
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,559
and eating out?

185
00:10:39,879 --> 00:10:41,159
No, I took a day off.

186
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,200
I came back early.

187
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,200
Okay, good.

188
00:10:43,519 --> 00:10:44,320
Let's eat together.

189
00:10:45,559 --> 00:10:45,919
Aunt Su.

190
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:46,879
Haoyu's back.

191
00:10:46,879 --> 00:10:47,960
My friend invited me to dinner.

192
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,360
Come with us.

193
00:10:49,559 --> 00:10:50,039
Let's go.

194
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:52,080
No, thanks. I have a lot of homework today.

195
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:53,000
I'll stay at home.

196
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:53,799
Well...

197
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,559
You really have homework?

198
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,639
Fine, it's rare for you to be so diligent.

199
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,279
Order something nice at home.

200
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:03,120
You're growing up. Don't skimp on food.

201
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,559
Let's go.

202
00:11:03,799 --> 00:11:04,320
Okay.

203
00:11:04,320 --> 00:11:05,320
Have something nice.

204
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:06,639
Thank you, Aunt Su.

205
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:10,840
Bye, Dad.

206
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,480
[Why is Jiang Yi at Li Haoyu's?]

207
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:42,120
[I'll ask him]

208
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:47,639
[about their relationship.]

209
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:39,440
Hello?

210
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:41,639
Li Haoyu, open the door.

211
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,039
What do you want?

212
00:12:45,039 --> 00:12:46,440
You keep calling.

213
00:12:46,519 --> 00:12:47,440
Open the door.

214
00:12:48,519 --> 00:12:49,559
What door?

215
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:50,840
Your front door.

216
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:52,480
My front door?

217
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,840
What are you doing here?

218
00:13:04,879 --> 00:13:05,679
Open the door.

219
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,200
Sit.

220
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,960
What do you want?

221
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:15,919
Li Haoyu,

222
00:13:15,919 --> 00:13:17,440
you're such a bad friend.

223
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:17,960
You're sick,

224
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,480
but you didn't tell us

225
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,639
or your dad.

226
00:13:20,879 --> 00:13:21,600
You're home alone,

227
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,679
not resting well.

228
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,440
Good thing we followed you here.

229
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,159
You shouldn't eat this when you're sick.

230
00:13:30,799 --> 00:13:31,799
Give it to Lin Qingyuan.

231
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,080
Right, drink more hot porridge.

232
00:13:34,320 --> 00:13:35,399
He hasn't eaten yet.

233
00:13:35,399 --> 00:13:36,240
Don't starve yourself.

234
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,720
Finally found some hot water.

235
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:41,679
This is really hot.

236
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:42,639
Let me blow on it for a bit.

237
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,240
Did you take your medicine?

238
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:49,000
It's okay, just eat the porridge first.

239
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:49,960
I'll make sure you eat it.

240
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:51,399
Let me help you first.

241
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,320
Right.

242
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,960
Come on, have some porridge.

243
00:13:56,679 --> 00:13:57,799
I'll do it myself.

244
00:13:58,320 --> 00:13:59,039
Don't move.

245
00:13:59,039 --> 00:13:59,919
Put this patch on.

246
00:14:00,039 --> 00:14:00,919
I'll do this myself too.

247
00:14:00,919 --> 00:14:01,159
I'll do it myself.

248
00:14:01,159 --> 00:14:01,600
How many pills should I take?

249
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:02,279
Which one should I take?

250
00:14:02,279 --> 00:14:02,759
Give it to me.

251
00:14:02,759 --> 00:14:03,679
Can you do it yourself?

252
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,519
I can.

253
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,840
How many pills should I take? So many characters.

254
00:14:08,159 --> 00:14:09,720
Alright, you guys stop fussing.

255
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:11,480
I'll eat the porridge myself.

256
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:12,480
I'll also take the medicine.

257
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,519
I'll apply this patch myself.

258
00:14:15,039 --> 00:14:15,919
You guys go back.

259
00:14:16,759 --> 00:14:17,759
That's not okay.

260
00:14:18,000 --> 00:14:19,159
We must watch you

261
00:14:19,159 --> 00:14:20,519
finish the porridge and take the medicine.

262
00:14:20,519 --> 00:14:21,799
Then we'll wait until you fall asleep before we go back.

263
00:14:30,759 --> 00:14:31,799
We'll do our homework

264
00:14:31,799 --> 00:14:32,480
to keep you company.

265
00:14:34,679 --> 00:14:36,320
So, take eight pills of this.

266
00:14:36,639 --> 00:14:38,200
