267
00:14:38,519 --> 00:14:39,440
You read it wrong.

268
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,799
Look at this.

269
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,200
Forget about the medicine.

270
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,240
Take out your homework.

271
00:14:43,399 --> 00:14:44,759
Right, don't look for it.

272
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:45,799
Do your homework.

273
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:48,799
Tidy up.

274
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:49,799
Tidy up.

275
00:14:58,759 --> 00:14:59,919
Tidy up your things.

276
00:15:00,559 --> 00:15:01,399
Almost done.

277
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:03,399
He should have come down from the fever, right?

278
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:04,919
Let's check again.

279
00:15:16,960 --> 00:15:17,600
It's gone.

280
00:15:17,919 --> 00:15:18,559
Okay.

281
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:19,200
Alright.

282
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:22,480
Then let's go.

283
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:24,360
Okay.

284
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,639
Take your medicine

285
00:16:21,759 --> 00:16:22,879
tomorrow morning.

286
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,440
I'm still a lucky girl,

287
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,080
aren't I?

288
00:16:35,480 --> 00:16:36,519
Yeah.

289
00:17:06,599 --> 00:17:07,000
Here.

290
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:13,480
Still upset

291
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:14,720
about Li Haoyu?

292
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,359
I didn't know

293
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:21,440
Jiang Yi was his step-sister.

294
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,519
When his family

295
00:17:22,519 --> 00:17:23,640
went out,

296
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,279
Li Haoyu seemed like an outsider.

297
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:29,240
We went to Jiang Yi alone.

298
00:17:30,279 --> 00:17:31,680
He must be very sad.

299
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:33,440
No one knew.

300
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:35,119
It's not your fault.

301
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,039
But I should know.

302
00:17:38,559 --> 00:17:39,559
We met each other

303
00:17:39,559 --> 00:17:40,359
when we were very young.

304
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,279
At that time,

305
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:45,200
we were very close.

306
00:17:46,359 --> 00:17:47,599
We shared everything

307
00:17:47,599 --> 00:17:49,000
with each other.

308
00:17:49,319 --> 00:17:51,119
Whenever I was upset,

309
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:52,839
he would always be there for me.

310
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:57,759
But now, when he's upset,

311
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,400
I can't do anything for him.

312
00:18:00,720 --> 00:18:02,200
So I feel very disappointed.

313
00:18:04,839 --> 00:18:05,960
It's not just that.

314
00:18:08,359 --> 00:18:09,880
I didn't expect that in these years,

315
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:11,640
I missed

316
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,279
so many important things about him.

317
00:18:22,559 --> 00:18:23,200
Look,

318
00:18:23,880 --> 00:18:25,279
there's a very bright star.

319
00:18:27,000 --> 00:18:28,000
Sirius.

320
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,799
Yes, Sirius.

321
00:18:31,519 --> 00:18:32,640
You should know that

322
00:18:33,799 --> 00:18:35,680
it takes eight years for the light of Sirius

323
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:36,759
to reach the earth.

324
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:38,400
That means

325
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,680
what we see now

326
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:43,000
is actually what it looked like eight years ago.

327
00:18:44,559 --> 00:18:45,720
So...

328
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:46,480
So,

329
00:18:47,759 --> 00:18:48,920
some people and things

330
00:18:49,720 --> 00:18:51,680
are like the light of Sirius.

331
00:18:52,240 --> 00:18:53,680
You think you've missed it,

332
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,400
but actually, it's still on its way.

333
00:18:59,039 --> 00:19:00,119
You two

334
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,599
may have been lost,

335
00:19:02,720 --> 00:19:03,440
but fortunately,

336
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:04,839
[you've found each other again.]

337
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:07,359
[As long as you don't part again,]

338
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,119
[the light of the past]

339
00:19:09,119 --> 00:19:10,960
[will surely shine again in the future.]

340
00:19:12,119 --> 00:19:12,960
[This applies to you,]

341
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,839
[and to Li Haoyu as well.]

342
00:19:26,119 --> 00:19:27,039
[Thank you.]

343
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:36,240
What are you two whispering about?

344
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,559
Wipe your mouth.

345
00:19:41,559 --> 00:19:43,000
You ate something behind our backs again.

346
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:44,119
What are you talking about?

347
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,559
I'm just tasting it.

348
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,799
Li Haoyu is sick too.

349
00:19:53,319 --> 00:19:55,279
Will he still participate in the Arts Festival?

350
00:19:56,319 --> 00:19:57,160
He must.

351
00:19:57,559 --> 00:19:58,480
Band performance

352
00:19:58,839 --> 00:19:59,599
is the best thing

353
00:19:59,599 --> 00:20:01,000
that can make Li Haoyu happy now.

354
00:20:02,559 --> 00:20:04,200
But where can we find

355
00:20:04,559 --> 00:20:05,920
a guitarist?

356
00:20:09,599 --> 00:20:10,839
You two good students.

357
00:20:11,359 --> 00:20:13,039
are you making this too complicated?

358
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,240
There's something

359
00:20:18,519 --> 00:20:19,599
called

360
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:20,720
cheating.

361
00:20:25,799 --> 00:20:26,920
I think it's a good idea.

362
00:20:26,920 --> 00:20:27,960
It must work.

363
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:33,000
There's plenty. Help yourselves.

364
00:20:46,440 --> 00:20:47,000
Zhou Yang,

365
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:50,160
you've been working so hard,

366
00:20:50,160 --> 00:20:51,119
practicing until now.

367
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:53,799
You even asked me

368
00:20:53,799 --> 00:20:55,039
where I was to bring snacks.

369
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:56,359
You're really troublesome.

370
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:57,920
It's a thank-you gift.

371
00:20:58,359 --> 00:20:59,680
Li Haoyu is fine now.

372
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:01,559
Have a seat.

373
00:21:13,319 --> 00:21:14,799
How did you know he was sick?

374
00:21:16,559 --> 00:21:17,880
Did you go to the infirmary too?

375
00:21:19,359 --> 00:21:20,039
No.

376
00:21:21,039 --> 00:21:22,279
I just happened to see

377
00:21:22,279 --> 00:21:24,359
a fake sick note in his hand.

378
00:21:36,599 --> 00:21:37,640
Actually, you do care about

379
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,720
the Basketball Club, don't you?

380
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:40,880
You are thinking too much.

381
00:21:42,319 --> 00:21:43,680
I just want to finish

382
00:21:43,680 --> 00:21:45,039
the task given by Director Qian.

383
00:21:45,400 --> 00:21:46,400
And I need the credits.

384
00:21:47,279 --> 00:21:48,559
You have the Student Union,

385
00:21:48,559 --> 00:21:50,039
violin and Olympiad mathematics.

386
00:21:50,039 --> 00:21:51,519
You still need credits?

387
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:52,559
Of course.

388
00:21:55,079 --> 00:21:57,400
And I won't take part in

389
00:21:58,079 --> 00:21:59,079
the Olympiad this year.

390
00:22:00,400 --> 00:22:01,160
Why?

391
00:22:04,319 --> 00:22:06,160
Don't you like math the most?

392
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:08,279
You like math, too.

393
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:10,480
You don't plan to take part in it, do you?

394
00:22:19,240 --> 00:22:20,319
This year,

395
00:22:20,319 --> 00:22:21,079
the school wants to let the students of Grade 11

396
00:22:21,079 --> 00:22:22,079
take part in the team competition.

397
00:22:22,319 --> 00:22:23,319
I don't want to waste my energy

398
00:22:23,319 --> 00:22:24,319
on cooperation.

399
00:22:24,599 --> 00:22:25,480
I have

400
00:22:25,519 --> 00:22:26,880
something more important to do.

401
00:22:27,839 --> 00:22:28,839
What is it?

402
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:31,880
It's getting late. Go back.

403
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,039
You haven't taken your stuff.

404
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,400
Li Haoyu.

405
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:11,079
Director.

406
00:23:11,720 --> 00:23:12,680
Have a seat.

407
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:14,559
Sit.

408
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:16,720
You're all better now.

409
00:23:16,880 --> 00:23:17,720
Thank you, Director.

410
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:18,599
I'm fully recovered.

411
00:23:18,599 --> 00:23:19,519
That's good to hear.

412
00:23:20,319 --> 00:23:21,079
Haoyu,

413
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:23,160
the school's been

414
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:25,200
so quiet without you.

415
00:23:25,839 --> 00:23:27,000
Quiet to the point

416
00:23:27,240 --> 00:23:28,519
that I even missed you.

417
00:23:33,279 --> 00:23:33,920
Sir,

418
00:23:34,440 --> 00:23:35,720
are you complimenting me

419
00:23:35,720 --> 00:23:36,759
or scolding me?

420
00:23:36,759 --> 00:23:38,319
No, just an objective comment.

421
00:23:38,319 --> 00:23:39,440
Come, have a seat.

422
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:42,720
Haoyu,

423
00:23:43,559 --> 00:23:44,960
you're a smart kid,

424
00:23:45,599 --> 00:23:47,279
but you're using that intelligence

425
00:23:47,519 --> 00:23:49,519
to get into trouble.

426
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:52,920
Why not play basketball,

427
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:53,960
or show some talent?

428
00:23:54,480 --> 00:23:55,319
Or,

429
00:23:55,319 --> 00:23:56,000
you could join

430
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:57,319
the arts festival.

431
00:23:58,759 --> 00:24:00,160
I'd love to join.

432
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:00,839
I'm the drummer

433
00:24:00,839 --> 00:24:02,200
of the Pulsar Band.

434
00:24:03,559 --> 00:24:04,440
Hello, sir.

435
00:24:04,720 --> 00:24:05,519
Goodbye, sir.

436
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:11,839
What's going on?

437
00:24:12,440 --> 00:24:13,799
What do you want?

438
00:24:13,799 --> 00:24:14,680
Why bring me here?

439
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,920
Let go of me!

440
00:24:30,440 --> 00:24:31,759
Are you a genius?

441
00:24:32,119 --> 00:24:33,759
You learned this in just a few days?

442
00:24:39,480 --> 00:24:40,480
What's this?

443
00:24:40,960 --> 00:24:41,799
This is...

444
00:24:41,799 --> 00:24:42,720
This is chord cheating.

445
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:44,240
This is a chord assistant.

446
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:45,799
Just press the button on it,

447
00:24:45,799 --> 00:24:47,319
and it can automatically play chords.

448
00:24:47,599 --> 00:24:48,799
Zhou Yang just needs to remember

449
00:24:48,799 --> 00:24:50,119
the right-hand rhythm

450
00:24:50,119 --> 00:24:51,200
and the left-hand button sequence.

451
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:51,920
That's it.

452
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:53,400
This is what I thought of.

453
00:24:53,400 --> 00:24:54,279
not bad, huh?

454
00:24:55,599 --> 00:24:56,160
Although

455
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,599
it can't play a solo,

456
00:24:57,599 --> 00:24:59,119
it can be used as an accompaniment.

457
00:24:59,119 --> 00:24:59,960
It's okay.

458
00:25:18,960 --> 00:25:20,079
What do you mean?

459
00:25:20,359 --> 00:25:21,240
Pity me?

460
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,119
Give me a guitarist.

461
00:25:25,480 --> 00:25:26,640
Don't think too much.

462
00:25:26,799 --> 00:25:27,759
We are for

463
00:25:27,759 --> 00:25:29,119
the prize of the Arts Festival,

464
00:25:29,720 --> 00:25:30,880
and the basketball team!

465
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:34,880
Check this out!

466
00:25:35,319 --> 00:25:36,880
I painted this myself,

467
00:25:36,880 --> 00:25:37,880
limited edition!

468
00:25:46,680 --> 00:25:47,400
Not bad, huh?

469
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:02,440
What is this?

470
00:26:02,440 --> 00:26:03,160
It's ugly!

471
00:26:17,640 --> 00:26:19,519
Since you're all so pumped,

472
00:26:19,519 --> 00:26:20,839
I can't let you down.

473
00:26:23,000 --> 00:26:24,119
Today, I'll show you

474
00:26:24,119 --> 00:26:24,680
the real deal,

475
00:26:24,680 --> 00:26:26,680
the real power of the Yibei Drum King.

476
00:26:27,119 --> 00:26:28,839
Alright, we're with you.

477
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:29,960
The four of us together,

478
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:31,039
we'll definitely rock the stage

479
00:26:31,039 --> 00:26:32,119
at the Arts Festival.

480
00:26:32,119 --> 00:26:32,759
Alright.

481
00:26:39,880 --> 00:26:41,119
Are you guys ready?

482
00:26:41,119 --> 00:26:42,119
Ready!

483
00:26:42,119 --> 00:26:43,680
Ladies and gentlemen,

484
00:26:43,680 --> 00:26:45,319
it's showtime!
